  user_input {
    user_response: "Good. Do not add any new features. Verify the Gemini AI Insights fallback change in the current workspace.\n\n1. Run the production build and relevant tests.\n2. Test the AI Insights endpoint with GEMINI_API_KEY missing or invalid, without exposing or changing any secrets.\n3. Confirm that it returns a safe, useful rule-based response and does not crash or interrupt the app.\n4. Check the AI Studio runtime error indicator and diagnose any remaining error.\n5. If a check fails, report the exact error before making a minimal fix.\n6. Report whether live Gemini API access was actually verified. Do not claim it works unless a real request succeeded.\n\nPreserve all existing changes."
    items {
      text: "Good. Do not add any new features. Verify the Gemini AI Insights fallback change in the current workspace.\n\n1. Run the production build and relevant tests.\n2. Test the AI Insights endpoint with GEMINI_API_KEY missing or invalid, without exposing or changing any secrets.\n3. Confirm that it returns a safe, useful rule-based response and does not crash or interrupt the app.\n4. Check the AI Studio runtime error indicator and diagnose any remaining error.\n5. If a check fails, report the exact error before making a minimal fix.\n6. Report whether live Gemini API access was actually verified. Do not claim it works unless a real request succeeded.\n\nPreserve all existing changes."
    }
  }
}
