iInsights test\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":65,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:27:12Z\",\"input_tokens\":2396,\"cache_read_tokens\":98889,\"output_tokens\":132,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"manage_task\",\"args\":{\"Action\":\"\\\"status\\\"\",\"TaskId\":\"\\\"080e128d-a2c7-4b30-b2c1-ba9ecac7f8a1/task-64\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking test task status\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check test status\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":68,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:27:13Z\",\"input_tokens\":3064,\"cache_read_tokens\":98876,\"output_tokens\":526,\"content\":\"\342\234\205 **Verification Summary & Results**\\n\\n1. **Production Build & Tests**: \\n   - Ran `npm run build` \342\200\224 build succeeded cleanly with zero errors.\\n   - Added and executed dedicated unit tests for the AI Insights endpoint (`src/test/aiInsights.test.ts`), which passed successfully.\\n\\n2. **AI Insights Fallback Testing (Missing / Invalid API Key)**:\\n   - Tested the `/api/v1/forecast/ai-insights` endpoint with `GEMINI_API_KEY` unconfigured (missing) and invalid.\\n   - Confirmed that the endpoint safely catches inval\\n<truncated 114 bytes>\\n fallback insights.\\n   - Confirmed the client application handles this gracefully without crashing or interrupting user workflows.\\n\\n3. **AI Studio Runtime Status**:\\n   - Checked application runtime error indicators \342\200\224 no remaining errors.\\n\\n4. **Live Gemini API Access Verification**:\\n   - **Live Gemini API access was NOT verified** with a real live key, as no production Gemini API key is provisioned in this test environment. The application correctly falls back to its robust rule-based operational insights.\",\"thinking\":\"**Verifying Test Results**\\n\\nI\'ve got good news! The AI Insights fallback tests have been marked as successful. I\'m now proceeding to methodically confirm that all the requirements outlined in the prompt are satisfied. So far, the production build was successful, and the pertinent AI Insights unit tests were also a success.\\n\\n\\n\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":69,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:37:37Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\n# SMARTMESS AI \342\200\224 FINAL HACKATHON PRODUCT COMPLETION\\n\\nWe are completing the existing SmartMess AI hackathon application. The latest project has been imported from the updated GitHub repository `Milhaan-7/smartmess-ai`, branch `main`.\\n\\nThis is an existing project with working code and previous changes. Our deadline is close.\\n\\n## NON-NEGOTIABLE RULE\\n\\n**Improve and complete the existing application. Do not rebuild it, reset it, replace its architecture, or discard existing changes.**\\n\\nRead `AI_\\n<truncated 12422 bytes>\\ntive is a stable, credible, demo-ready SmartMess AI product, not a collection of unfinished features. Preserve all current changes.\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-20T10:37:37-07:00.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.5-flash-lite\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-27vsgfgocgal3hk7jidvju-794565525699.asia-southeast1.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-27vsgfgocgal3hk7jidvju-794565525699.asia-southeast1.run.app\\nUser Email: mahmoodmilhaan777@gmail.com\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":70,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:37:37Z\",\"input_tokens\":105365,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":459,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing the Project Scope**\\n\\nOkay, I\'m diving into the SmartMess AI project. I\'m taking stock of the React SPA, Express backend, and the PostgreSQL/Drizzle database setup. The goal is a clear understanding of the current workspace and to preserve a stable checkpoint to use later.\\n\