\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":76,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:37:58Z\",\"input_tokens\":5298,\"cache_read_tokens\":111425,\"output_tokens\":736,\"thinking\":\"**Refining Login Design**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on the `src/pages/Login.tsx` design. I\'ve been considering the visual improvements needed, like the deep navy background, refined emerald accents, high-contrast text, and professional typography. I\'m aiming for consistent spacing and subtle gradients to achieve a premium aesthetic. The goal is to make it visually appealing and accessible for all users.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/layout/Sidebar.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Reading Sidebar.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Read Sidebar.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":78,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:38:03Z\",\"input_tokens\":3790,\"cache_read_tokens\":115605,\"output_tokens\":5693,\"thinking\":\"**Considering Navigation Inclusion**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on integrating \\\"AI Assistant\\\" into the existing navigation system. I\'m exploring the implications of making it universally accessible versus limiting it to specific roles, such as managers, staff, or students. My priority is to add it without disrupting the current structure.\\n\\n\\n**Refining Navigation Scope**\\n\\nI\'m now zeroing in on defining access levels for the AI Assistant within the navigation. It seems wise to include \\\"ai-assistant\\\" in `NAV_ITEMS\\n<truncated 839 bytes>\\nrontend Features**\\n\\nI\'m now fully immersed in the frontend implementation. I\'m focusing on the `AiAssistant.tsx` page to create a professional, branded chat interface. This includes a matching aesthetic with message bubbles, timestamps, and suggested prompts. I\'ve defined a robust set of suggested prompts, enabling users to readily interact and explore the data, with the aim of reducing the effort required to utilize the AI. Finally, I will ensure elegant fallback behaviour in the event of any API error.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"Append\":\"false\",\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import { useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport { ShieldCheck, ChefHat, GraduationCap, ArrowRight, Sparkles, Building2, Utensils, CheckCircle2, Lock, TrendingUp, BarChart3, Clock } from \'lucide-react\';\\\\nimport { useAppStore, type UserRole } from \'../store/AppSt\\n<truncated 15923 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Redesign login page with premium AI SaaS look, deep navy background, emerald accents, and clear product preview\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/pages/Login.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Redesigning login page\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Redesign Login.tsx\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\",\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":80,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:38:17Z\",\"input_tokens\":7608,\"cache_read_tokens\":117988,\"output_tokens\":593,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing the Redesign**\\n\\nI\'m impressed with the login redesign; it\'s sharp and polished. I\'m now shifting gears to the AI conversational assistant, and I\'m currently assessing the necessary components and endpoints for implementation. I\'m starting by identifying the essential building blocks for this Priority 2 feature.\\n\\n\\n**Defining the AI Chat Endpoint**\\n\\nI\'ve scoped out the backend endpoint `POST /api/v1/chat`. It will ingest application data, compute the required answers, and call `@google/genai` (gemini-3.8-flash) using an API key from `process.env`. Error handling is crucial; the endpoint will return rule-based responses if keys are missing or the API fails. Now, I\'m sketching the frontend page (`AiAssistant.tsx`) to render a conversational chat screen and updating navigation to include an \\\"ai-assistant\\\" item.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/api/routes.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"843\",\"StartLine\":\"810\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing bottom of routes.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View routes.ts tail\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":82,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:38:23Z\",\"input_tokens\":2760,\"cache_read_tokens\":124359,\"output_tokens\":378,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/api/routes.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"848\",\"StartLine\":\"830\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing routes.ts tail\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View routes.ts tail\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":84,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:38:27Z\",\"input_tokens\":3664,\"cache_read_tokens\":124339,\"output_tokens\":1923,\"thinking\":\"**Defining the API Endpoint**\\n\\nI\'m currently working on defining the `/api/v1/chat` endpoint within `src/api/routes.ts`. Using `replace_file_content`, I\'m drafting the initial structure and function signature, including the required authentication middleware.\\n\\n\\n**Processing the Request Body**\\n\\nI\'ve moved on to handling the request body within the `/api/v1/chat` endpoint. Now, I\'m validating the presence and format of the \'message\' field and ensuring it\'s a non-empty string. I\'m also retrieving the user\'s ro\\n<truncated 1291 bytes>\\nred, I\'ll be referencing the computed metrics, being careful not to fabricate any unreal data. The approved plans count is ${dataContext.approvedPlansCount}.\\n\\n\\n**Formulating AI Responses**\\n\\nI\'m now generating tailored replies depending on the user\'s query and role. If the query asks for a comparison of data, I\'ll provide details like total waste and top contributing dishes. Questions on attendance get the relevant details. Also, I\'m making sure to respond with details about the approved plans when asked.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/api/routes.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"848\",\"StartLine\":\"835\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing routes.ts end\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View routes.ts end\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\"]}\n{\"step_index\":86,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:38:34Z\",\"input_tokens\":3953,\"cache_read_tokens\":126850,\"output_tokens\":1913,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Add POST /api/v1/chat endpoint for SmartMess AI conversational assistant with backend data context and fallback handling\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"848\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Append the /chat endpoint after the ai-insights route\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"    return res.json({\\\\n      available: false,\\\\n      reason: `Gemini API Error: ${errMsg}`,\\\\n      insights: [\\\\n        `Historical demand baseline for ${meal || \'service\'} is ${baselineDiners ?? 450} diners; model predicted ${predictedDiners ?? 480} din\\n<truncated 6732 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"836\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/api/routes.ts\\\"\",\"TargetLintErrorIds\":\"[]\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Adding chat API route\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update routes.ts\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":88,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:38:39Z\",\"input_tokens\":3941,\"cache_read_tokens\":128889,\"output_tokens\":95,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/api/routes.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"848\",\"StartLine\":\"830\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing routes.ts end\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View routes.ts end\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":90,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T17:38:43Z\",\"input_tokens\