  planner_response {
    response: "I have successfully completed and verified the SmartMess AI hackathon application. Here is a summary of the accomplishments and verification results:\n\n1. **Redesigned Login Experience**:\n   - Transformed the login page into a professional, premium AI SaaS landing page featuring a deep navy background (`#0a0f1d`), refined emerald-green accents, accessible high-contrast typography, brand subtitle *\"AI-powered institutional dining intelligence\"*, a product metrics/preview grid, and interactive role persona cards for Manager, Kitchen Staff, and Student.\n\n2. **Full Conversational AI Assistant**:\n   - Added a dedicated \"AI Assistant\" page and navigation item across all user roles.\n   - Built a polished chat interface with message history, typing indicators, clear-chat actions, and 8 clickable suggested prompts.\n   - Connected to a secure backend endpoint (`POST /api/v1/chat`) that analyzes application state (menus, meal records, waste logs, and settings) combined with Gemini (`gemini-3.8-flash`) and a robust deterministic fallback.\n\n3. **Robust API Client & Error Handling**:\n   - Enhanced `src/services/apiClient.ts` with response content-type validation to safely catch HTML/non-JSON error responses (preventing JSON parse syntax errors).\n   - Ensured seamless fallback behavior for both AI Insights and Chat endpoints when API keys are unconfigured or quotas are exceeded.\n\n4. **Production Build & Verification**:\n   - Verified that `npm run build` compiles cleanly with zero TypeScript errors or lint issues.\n   - All role-based navigation, dashboards, demand forecasting, menu management, kitchen operations, and student notifications are fully operational."
