p\') || query.includes(\'target\') || query.includes(\'approved\')) {\n      reply = `For breakfast service (including idlis), historical demand averages 420-450 diners with a 10% safety buffer. We recommend preparing 460 portions split into two batches (320 at opening, 140 for second batch) to maintain freshness and eliminate surplus waste. There are currently ${dataContext.approvedPlansCount} approved preparation plans active in the system.`;\n    } else if (query.includes(\'waste\') || query.includes(\'leftover\') || query.includes(\'last 30 days\') || query.includes(\'compare\')) {"
