  planner_response {
    response: "I have successfully implemented and verified all requested fixes and refinements in SmartMess AI:\n\n1. **AI Assistant Access Restriction**:\n   - Restricted the AI Assistant feature exclusively to the **Mess Manager** role.\n   - Hidden the AI Assistant navigation item for **Kitchen Staff** and **Student/Diner** roles (`Sidebar.tsx`).\n   - Protected frontend routes so non-manager roles attempting direct navigation are redirected safely (`App.tsx`).\n   - Enforced server-side manager-only authorization on `POST /api/v1/chat` using `requireRole([\'manager\'])`, ensuring unauthorized requests return HTTP 403 with a consistent JSON error response.\n   - Verified via unit test suites (`src/test/aiAssistantAuth.test.ts`).\n\n2. **Login Page Design A**:\n   - Confirmed and polished the login experience with professional AI SaaS styling, institutional dining messaging, and quick demo role selection.\n\n3. **AI Assistant End-to-End Verification**:\n   - Verified valid JSON response handling, idli and breakfast preparation queries, and safe fallback mechanics when Gemini is unavailable, without ever exposing API keys."
    modified_response: "I have successfully implemented and verified all requested fixes and refinements in SmartMess AI:\n\n1. **AI Assistant Access Restriction**:\n   - Restricted the AI Assistant feature exclusively to the **Mess Manager** role.\n   - Hidden the AI Assistant navigation item for **Kitchen Staff** and **Student/Diner** roles (`Sidebar.tsx`).\n   - Protected frontend routes so non-manager roles attempting direct navigation are redirected safely (`App.tsx`).\n   - Enforced server-side manager-only authorization on `POST /api/v1/chat` using `requireRole([\'manager\'])`, ensuring unauthorized requests return HTTP 403 with a consistent JSON error response.\n   - Verified via unit test suites (`src/test/aiAssistantAuth.test.ts`).\n\n2. **Login Page Design A**:\n   - Confirmed and polished the login experience with professional AI SaaS styling, institutional dining messaging, and quick demo role selection.\n\n3. **AI Assistant End-to-End Verification**:\n   - Verified valid JSON response handling, idli and breakfast preparation queries, and safe fallback mechanics when Gemini is unavailable, without ever exposing API keys."
