      content: "Task id \"080e128d-a2c7-4b30-b2c1-ba9ecac7f8a1/task-346\" finished with result:\nCommand output:\n RUN  v3.2.7 /app/appletstderr | src/test/aiAssistantAuth.test.ts\342\227\207 injected env (0) from .envstderr | src/test/aiAssistantAuth.test.ts > AI Assistant Authorization & Chat Endpoint > denies student role with 403 Forbidden[Users] Database unconfigured: skipping user lookup for demo-student-uidstderr | src/test/aiAssistantAuth.test.ts > AI Assistant Authorization & Chat Endpoint > denies student role with 403 Forbidden[Auth] Database unconfigured during demo token verification: falling back to demo userstderr | src/test/aiAssistantAuth.test.ts > AI Assistant Authorization & Chat Endpoint > denies kitchen staff role with 403 Forbidden[Users] Database unconfigured: skipping user lookup for demo-staff-uidstderr | src/test/aiAssistantAuth.test.ts > AI Assistant Authorization & Chat Endpoint > denies kitchen staff role with 403 Forbidden[Auth] Database unconfigured during demo token verification: falling back to demo userstderr | src/test/aiAssistantAuth.test.ts > AI Assistant Authorization & Chat Endpoint > allows manager role and handles idli preparation question with JSON response[Users] Database unconfigured: skipping user lookup for demo-manager-uidstderr | src/test/aiAssistantAuth.test.ts > AI Assistant Authorization & Chat Endpoint > allows manager role and handles idli preparation question with JSON response[Auth] Database unconfigured during demo token verification: falling back to demo userstderr | src/test/aiAssistantAuth.test.ts > AI Assistant Authorization & Chat Endpoint > allows manager role and handles idli preparation question with JSON response[Chat] Gemini API call skipped/failed, falling back to deterministic data assistant: {\"error\":{\"code\":503,\"message\":\"This model is currently experiencing high demand. Spikes in demand are usually temporary. Please try again later.\",\"status\":\"UNAVAILABLE\"}} \342\234\223 src/test/aiAs