    response: "I have successfully redesigned the login page (`src/pages/Login.tsx`) into a deliberate, professionally art-directed enterprise software experience, removing all generic AI template patterns and replacing them with an editorial split-screen layout.\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **Left Brand & Storytelling Panel (~54% width)**:\n   - Features a high-quality institutional dining hall photograph with a natural photographic treatment and restrained darkening gradient overlay.\n   - Displays the SmartMess AI wordmark paired with the brand\'s leaf icon.\n   - Includes the eyebrow label *\"DINING OPERATIONS INTELLIGENCE\"*, headline *\"Plan better. Prepare smarter. Waste less.\"*, concise supporting text, and three baseline capabilities (*Demand forecasting \302\267 Preparation planning \302\267 Waste monitoring*).\n\n2. **Right Interaction & Demo Entry Area (~46% width)**:\n   - Clean, professional enterprise surface with ample whitespace and clear hierarchy (*\"Welcome to SmartMess AI\"* / *\"Choose your workspace to continue\"*).\n   - Replaced bulky marketing cards with three compact, well-designed selectable rows for **Mess Manager** (with administrative + AI assistant indicator), **Kitchen Staff**, and **Student / Diner**.\n   - Entire row is interactive with smooth hover and focus indicator states.\n   - Clean footer noting *\"Demo environment \302\267 Synthetic data\"*.\n\n3. **Preservation & Verification**:\n   - Preserved all existing role sign-in actions, routing, manager-only AI assistant restrictions, and backend API contracts.\n   - Verified that the production build (`npm run build`), TypeScript checks (`tsc --noEmit`), linting, and unit test suites pass cleanly with zero errors."
    modified_response: "I have successfully redesigned the login page (`src/pages/Login.tsx`) into a deliberate, professionally art-directed enterprise software experience, removing all generic AI template patterns and replacing them with an editorial split-screen layout.\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **Left Brand & Storytelling Panel (~54% width)**:\n   - Features a high-quality institutional dining hall photograph with a natural photographic treatment and restrained darkening gradient overlay.\n   - Displays the SmartMess AI wordmark paired with the brand\'s leaf icon.\n   - Includes the eyebrow label *\"DINING OPERATIONS INTELLIGENCE\"*, headline *\"Plan better. Prepare smarter. Waste less.\"*, concise supporting text, and three baseline capabilities (*Demand forecasting \302\267 Preparation planning \302\267 Waste monitoring*).\n\n2. **Right Interaction & Demo Entry Area (~46% width)**:\n   - Clean, professional enterprise surface with ample whitespace and clear hierarchy (*\"Welcome to SmartMess AI\"* / *\"Choose your workspace to continue\"*).\n   - Replaced bulky marketing cards with three compact, well-designed selectable rows for **Mess Manager** (with administrative + AI assistant indicator), **Kitchen Staff**, and **Student / Diner**.\n   - Entire row is interactive with smooth hover and focus indicator states.\n   - Clean footer noting *\"Demo environment \302\267 Synthetic data\"*.\n\n3. **Preservation & Verification**:\n   - Preserved all existing role sign-in actions, routing, manager-only AI assistant restrictions, and backend API contracts.\n   - Verified that the production build (`npm run build`), TypeScript checks (`tsc --noEmit`), linting, and unit test suites pass cleanly with zero errors."
