  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Login Page**\n\nI\'m focusing on clarifying the \"synthetic-data demo entry\" within `src/pages/Login.tsx`. My current thought is to add explicit labeling to the role buttons or incorporate a \"Synthetic Data Demo Entry\" badge, perhaps a helper text. This honest messaging will improve user understanding.\n\n\n**Improving UI Honesty**\n\nI\'ve decided to label the role buttons explicitly with \"Synthetic Demo Entry\". I\'m also changing the left panel footer text. I\'ll replace \"Enterprise institutional tier\" with \"Interactive Hackathon Demo\" and \"Verified operations runtime\" to \"Synthetic Baseline Dataset\". Next, I\'m focusing on keyboard accessibility, adding focus and active states to improve the UI. Finally, I\'m documenting session storage in `localStorage`.\n\n\n"
