pe\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T18:23:58Z\",\"input_tokens\":2929,\"cache_read_tokens\":74555,\"output_tokens\":89,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"manage_task\",\"args\":{\"Action\":\"\\\"status\\\"\",\"TaskId\":\"\\\"080e128d-a2c7-4b30-b2c1-ba9ecac7f8a1/task-350\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking test suite status\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check test suite status\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":367,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T18:24:00Z\",\"input_tokens\":3156,\"cache_read_tokens\":74543,\"output_tokens\":89,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"manage_task\",\"args\":{\"Action\":\"\\\"status\\\"\",\"TaskId\":\"\\\"080e128d-a2c7-4b30-b2c1-ba9ecac7f8a1/task-350\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking test suite status\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check test suite status\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":369,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T18:24:01Z\",\"input_tokens\":3383,\"cache_read_tokens\":74531,\"output_tokens\":195,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"manage_task\",\"args\":{\"Action\":\"\\\"kill\\\"\",\"TaskId\":\"\\\"080e128d-a2c7-4b30-b2c1-ba9ecac7f8a1/task-350\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Killing running test task\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Kill test task\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":372,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T18:24:02Z\",\"input_tokens\":4000,\"cache_read_tokens\":76564,\"output_tokens\":64,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"compile_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Compiling applet to verify final build\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Compile applet\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":374,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T18:24:27Z\",\"input_tokens\":2088,\"cache_read_tokens\":78622,\"output_tokens\":461,\"content\":\"I have successfully implemented and verified all requested fixes and refinements in SmartMess AI:\\n\\n1. **AI Assistant Access Restriction**:\\n   - Restricted the AI Assistant feature exclusively to the **Mess Manager** role.\\n   - Hidden the AI Assistant navigation item for **Kitchen Staff** and **Student/Diner** roles (`Sidebar.tsx`).\\n   - Protected frontend routes so non-manager roles attempting direct navigation are redirected safely (`App.tsx`).\\n   - Enforced server-side manager-only authorization on `POST \\n<truncated 88 bytes>\\nTP 403 with a consistent JSON error response.\\n   - Verified via unit test suites (`src/test/aiAssistantAuth.test.ts`).\\n\\n2. **Login Page Design A**:\\n   - Confirmed and polished the login experience with professional AI SaaS styling, institutional dining messaging, and quick demo role selection.\\n\\n3. **AI Assistant End-to-End Verification**:\\n   - Verified valid JSON response handling, idli and breakfast preparation queries, and safe fallback mechanics when Gemini is unavailable, without ever exposing API keys.\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":331,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T18:25:48Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nThe dev server didn\'t start, please fix it\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-20T11:25:48-07:00.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.5-flash-lite\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-27vsgfgocgal3hk7jidvju-794565525699.asia-southeast1.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-27vsgfgocgal3hk7jidvju-794565525699.asia-southeast1.run.app\\nUser Email: mahmoodmilhaan777@gmail.com\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\"}\n{\"step_index\":332,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T18:25:48Z\",\"input_tokens\":64838,\"cache_read_tokens\":16548,\"output_tokens\":59,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"restart_dev_server\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Restarting development server\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Restart 