est/aiInsights.test.ts\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\".\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"8000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Running unit tests\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Run unit tests\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":347,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T03:06:46Z\",\"input_tokens\":3641,\"cache_read_tokens\":114538,\"output_tokens\":91,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"manage_task\",\"args\":{\"Action\":\"\\\"status\\\"\",\"TaskId\":\"\\\"080e128d-a2c7-4b30-b2c1-ba9ecac7f8a1/task-346\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking test task status\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check test status\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":349,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T03:06:47Z\",\"input_tokens\":3871,\"cache_read_tokens\":114525,\"output_tokens\":98,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"manage_task\",\"args\":{\"Action\":\"\\\"status\\\"\",\"TaskId\":\"\\\"080e128d-a2c7-4b30-b2c1-ba9ecac7f8a1/task-346\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking test task status\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check test status\\\"\",\"waitForPreviousTools\":\"true\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":352,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T03:06:48Z\",\"input_tokens\":2845,\"cache_read_tokens\":116580,\"output_tokens\":558,\"content\":\"I have successfully implemented the genuine desktop split-screen layout (Design A) for the Login page and resolved the student role-access wording.\\n\\n### Summary of Changes & Verification\\n\\n1. **Login Page Redesign (`src/pages/Login.tsx`)**:\\n   - Replaced the old centered hero layout with a genuine desktop split-screen layout (`lg:grid lg:grid-cols-12`).\\n   - **Left Side (~58% width / `lg:col-span-7`)**: Features a full-height institutional commercial kitchen photograph with a dark navy gradient overlay (`bg-\\n<truncated 733 bytes>\\nhavior**: Automatically adapts from side-by-side split screen on desktop/tablet to stacked vertical layout on mobile, keeping all role choices fully accessible.\\n\\n2. **Build & Test Results**:\\n   - **TypeScript Compilation (`tsc --noEmit`)**: Passed with 0 errors.\\n   - **Production Build (`npm run build`)**: Passed successfully.\\n   - **Unit & Auth Tests (`vitest`)**: All tests passed successfully (including manager-only AI Assistant authorization, student/kitchen staff 403 enforcement, and AI fallback tests).\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":330,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T03:12:31Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\n# SmartMess AI \342\200\224 Art-Directed Login Redesign (Remove the AI-Generated Template Look)\\n\\nRedesign the ACTUAL initial login/demo-entry page of my existing SmartMess AI application. The current page looks like a generic AI-generated landing page. I want a deliberate, professionally art-directed enterprise product experience.\\n\\nDo not create a new project. Do not rebuild the entire application. Do not change backend functionality, role permissions, routing, or existing workflows. Focus on the init\\n<truncated 6840 bytes>\\n inspected.\\n\\nStart by inspecting the existing login component, then implement this new art direction directly in the existing page.\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-20T20:12:31-07:00.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.5-flash-lite\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-27vsgfgocgal3hk7jidvju-794565525699.asia-southeast1.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-27vsgfgocgal3hk7jidvju-794565525699.asia-southeast1.run.app\\nUser Email: mahmoodmilhaan777@gmail.com\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":331,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T03:12:31Z\",\"input_tokens\":121719,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":3824,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing Login Page Design**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on the Login page redesign. I\'m prioritizing eliminating the generic, AI-template aesthetic. Specifically, oversized gradient text and glowing background gradients are targeted for removal. My primary goal is a professional, art-directed design. I\'m exploring different layouts and visual hierarchies.\\n\\n\\n**Refining Visual Hierarchy**\\n\\nI\'ve been working on a new approach, moving towards a restrained, premium software design. I\'m imagining a high-quality ph\\n<truncated 274 bytes>\\nr Palettes**\\n\\nI\'m now diving into the specific color palette for the login page. I\'m wavering between a clean, light neutral surface (like `#f8fafc`) and a refined dark enterprise theme. I\'m focusing on consistency with the rest of the SmartMess AI application, specifically its navy/slate-900 backgrounds. I want a premium feel, avoiding heavy shadows and aiming for a Linear/Vercel/Notion enterprise styling, either light or dark. I\'m currently leaning towards `bg-slate-50` for light or `#0B132B` for dark.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"Append\":\"false\",\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import { useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport { ShieldCheck, ChefHat, GraduationCap, ArrowRight, Leaf, Building2 } from \'lucide-react\';\\\\nimport { useAppStore, type UserRole } from \'../store/AppStore\';\\\\nimport { hrefFor } from \'../lib/router\';\\\\n\\\\nexport defaul\\n<truncated 10042 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Redesign Login page into a refined, art-directed enterprise split-screen layout with professional editorial typography, high-quality institutional dining photo on left, and compact selectable role rows on right\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/pages/Login.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Implementing art-directed login redesign\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Implement Login.tsx art-directed design\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\",\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":333,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"P