test task status\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check test status\\\"\",\"waitForPreviousTools\":\"true\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":352,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T03:21:21Z\",\"input_tokens\":10192,\"cache_read_tokens\":133307,\"output_tokens\":88,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"manage_task\",\"args\":{\"Action\":\"\\\"status\\\"\",\"TaskId\":\"\\\"080e128d-a2c7-4b30-b2c1-ba9ecac7f8a1/task-349\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking test task status\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check test status\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":354,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T03:21:22Z\",\"input_tokens\":2088,\"cache_read_tokens\":141625,\"output_tokens\":95,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"manage_task\",\"args\":{\"Action\":\"\\\"kill\\\"\",\"TaskId\":\"\\\"080e128d-a2c7-4b30-b2c1-ba9ecac7f8a1/task-349\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Killing task 349\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Kill task\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":357,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T03:21:24Z\",\"input_tokens\":2856,\"cache_read_tokens\":141602,\"output_tokens\":75,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"compile_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Compiling applet for final verification\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Compile applet\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":359,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T03:21:46Z\",\"input_tokens\":3025,\"cache_read_tokens\":141590,\"output_tokens\":374,\"content\":\"I have successfully completed the focused final refinements on the SmartMess AI application:\\n\\n1. **Login Page Refinements (`src/pages/Login.tsx`)**:\\n   - Preserved the split-screen Design A layout and institutional photography.\\n   - Updated copy and role entry buttons to honestly and clearly communicate **Synthetic Data Demo Entry**.\\n   - Replaced unsupported claims such as \\\"Enterprise institutional tier\\\" and \\\"Verified operations runtime\\\" with accurate messaging (*\\\"Interactive Hackathon Demo \302\267 Synthetic Ba\\n<truncated 243 bytes>\\nly in `localStorage` via `AppStore` and verified against durable PostgreSQL user rows or fallback demo tokens on backend requests (`src/middleware/auth.ts`). Client-side role selection provides rapid hackathon demonstration, while backend endpoints strictly enforce role authorization (`requireRole`).\\n\\n3. **Build & Test Verification**:\\n   - Production build (`npm run build`), TypeScript checks (`tsc --noEmit`), and unit tests (`aiAssistantAuth.test.ts`, `aiInsights.test.ts`) all passed cleanly with 0 errors.\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":330,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T03:34:34Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nContinue working on the existing SmartMess AI project from its current saved state. The previous generation was cancelled with \342\200\234The caller does not have permission\342\200\235 and an unexpected error.\\n\\nBefore making any changes:\\n1. Inspect the current project state and identify any incomplete or partially applied edits.\\n2. Check whether the existing app still runs and whether the latest login redesign and manager-only AI access restrictions are present.\\n3. Identify the exact remaining runtime or bui\\n<truncated 129 bytes>\\nfest next action before attempting substantial edits.\\n\\nDo not expose secrets or change project permissions, billing, or cloud resources.\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-20T20:34:34-07:00.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.6-flash\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-27vsgfgocgal3hk7jidvju-794565525699.asia-southeast1.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-27vsgfgocgal3hk7jidvju-794565525699.asia-southeast1.run.app\\nUser Email: mahmoodmilhaan777@gmail.com\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\",\"truncated_fields\":[