have passed. This gives me a lot of confidence that everything is functioning as expected in those modules. This positive outcome is a significant step toward confirming the overall project\'s stability and reliability. We are currently focusing on comparing the status to the user\'s checklist.\\n\\n\\n\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":331,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T03:40:26Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\n# SMARTMESS AI \342\200\224 FINAL APPLICATION AUDIT, UI POLISH & HACKATHON READINESS\\n\\nYou are continuing work on my existing SmartMess AI project. The latest implementation reportedly includes the Design A login page, manager-only AI Assistant access, server-side role authorization, improved JSON handling, and AI fallback behaviour.\\n\\nYour task is to conduct a comprehensive final audit of the ENTIRE application, fix remaining real issues, improve visual consistency, and verify the running app before de\\n<truncated 12180 bytes>\\nidentifying the highest-impact verified gaps, and fixing them in a safe order. Preserve working features and avoid unnecessary rewrites.\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-20T20:40:26-07:00.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.6-flash\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-27vsgfgocgal3hk7jidvju-794565525699.asia-southeast1.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-27vsgfgocgal3hk7jidvju-794565525699.asia-southeast1.run.app\\nUser Email: mahmoodmilhaan777@gmail.com\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":332,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T03:40:26Z\",\"input_tokens\":92016,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":94,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"compile_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Compiling applet for final audit verification\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Compile applet\\\"\"}}]}"
