  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Revising API Routes**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the `/auth/session` route within `src/api/routes.ts`. My aim is to gracefully handle database unavailability during the `getUserByUid` or `getOrCreateUser` calls. The goal is to ensure a smooth demo authentication and session exchange even when the database is offline, and avoid that 503 error.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_251214"
      name: "replace_file_content"
