  planner_response {
    response: "I have resolved the database initialization and seed deferral issues in SmartMess AI:\n\n1. **Graceful Database Fallback Handling**:\n   - Updated `server.ts` and `src/db/seed.ts` to check `resolveDatabaseConfig().configured` prior to attempting database queries.\n   - Wrapped database seed queries in `seedDatabaseIfEmpty` in try-catch logic so that unconfigured or deferred PostgreSQL connections log clean, informative warnings (`[Server] Database persistence unconfigured \342\200\224 operating in demo/in-memory mode`) rather than failing unhandled queries.\n\n2. **Resilient Session & Demo Mode**:\n   - Enhanced `/api/v1/auth/session` in `src/api/routes.ts` to seamlessly fall back to demo user profiles when database persistence is not configured or offline, enabling uninterrupted demo login across all roles (Mess Manager, Kitchen Staff, Student/Diner).\n\n3. **Build & Lint Verification**:\n   - Both `npm run build` (`compile_applet`) and TypeScript lint checks (`lint_applet`) compile cleanly with zero errors."
